<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse suspends Goldsun trading.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse suspends Goldsun trading.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said on Friday it suspended trading in frozen food manufacturer Goldsun shares for the whole session following newspaper reports of large losses in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;On January 17, 1997, Napi Gazdasag (newspaper) published a story titled 'Goldsun: Gigantic losses', which informed readers that...Goldsun Rt's 1996 losses approached 850 million forints...,&quot; the BSE's statement said.</p>
</text>
